%{

everything is fly perspective unless noted 

yaw aka heading 

CCW = decreasing yaw 
CW = increasing yaw

CW turn = CCW cue & ball = cue yaw decreasing = fly yaw (ie heading)

yaw position: 0 = 1 o'clock (fly facing out of box on Berg1) 

Berg1 stacks: 
    --rostral = bottom of image (increasing Y) 
    --left brain hemisphere = right side of image

